    "label": "38",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following, expressing roots as fractional exponents. $\\sqrt{9y^3}$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$3y^{\\frac32}$, $y\\ge0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{9y^3}&=9^{\\frac12}y^{\\frac32}\\\\\\sqrt{9y^3}&=3y^{\\frac32}\\end{align*}$$For a real square root, $9y^3\\ge0$, so $y\\ge0$.",
